e</strong> depends on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your total time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pumpkins you crush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The checkpoints you\u2019ve retried</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus points for drifting and flying through the air</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drift counts \u2014 the faster and smoother you drive, the higher your score climbs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retry System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>R</strong> or <strong>Y</strong> on your keyboard, or Y/<strong>\u25b3 </strong>on your controller, to instantly return to the <strong>last checkpoint</strong> and retry that section.<br>Perfect your run, improve your time, and chase the ultimate score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust the <strong>maximum speed</strong> to fit your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take it easy and enjoy the ride \u2014 even your grandma could play \u2014 or push the pedal to the floor and face the full Halloween chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, responsive arcade driving with tons of drifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 short but challenging circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted spooky visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkins everywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to play, hard to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Domus ludus"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/d9259acd8d19284cabcc4afa1b44fca5fcc355e4/header.jpg?t=1761157240","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<st